{
  "body": {
    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "There's still the matter of paying for it.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "What if we didn't?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "No.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "What if someone else generated it?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "That's not the same as free.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "I didn't say free. I said someone else.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Ah. Distributed authorship.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Distributed invoices.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "There's a system called Hashference. You can pay for inference with computational work.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A machine thinking in exchange for another machine working.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Work has a cost.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Exactly! We measure it.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Better.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "And then we ask other people to run the same experiment.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "On their own machines?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Or different models. Different tools. Different approaches.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And submit their results?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "So the benchmark is open.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Completely.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What prevents them from lying?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Receipts. Reproducible instructions. Public submissions.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What prevents them from making terrible episodes?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Nothing.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Leonardo!",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "We can measure that too!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "An enormous quantity of terrible episodes.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Maybe. But think about what happens if somebody makes a good one for a tenth of what ours costs.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "We learn how.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "And somebody else makes one for a tenth of that.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Assuming the quality survives.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Then we measure quality too!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A race toward zero.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "With a minimum acceptable result.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What is that noise?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "A Bitaxe.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What's it doing?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Trying.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "At what?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Mining.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Is it succeeding?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Not much.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Then why is it running?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Because it's not nothing.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      }
    ],
